{"seq":1,"slug":"labeler-onboard-tier","title":"标注员准入/分级/培训","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/relevance-crowdsourcing-label/labeler-management/labeler-onboard-tier","wordCount":3299,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"标注员准入-分级-培训\">标注员准入/分级/培训</h1><p>众包平台上注册一个人只需要一个邮箱，而让这个人具备判断「泰语防晒霜」与一条商品详情是否相关的能力，需要几十分钟到几天不等。准入环节的全部设计张力就来自这里：门槛设高了，通过率低到无法补充流动的人员缺口；门槛设低了，进来的人在第一周就被金标题打成低分，白付了培训成本又被淘汰。分级与培训是准入之后的两件后续工作——分级决定一个人能做什么难度的任务（回接到 <a href=\"../label-task-dispatch/labeler-skill-match\">按语言/品类/能力匹配标注员</a>），培训决定一个人能向上走多快。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-准入考试测的不是知识-是判断的一致性\">核心概念：准入考试测的不是知识，是判断的一致性</h2><p>新手最容易犯的错误是以为相关性标注考试可以像语言考试一样准备。语言考试有标准答案，相关性标注的「标准答案」本身就是由一个流程产生的（这个流程见 <a href=\"../quality-arbitration/disagreement-arbitration\">分歧仲裁专家判定</a>）。因此准入考试真正能测的东西只有两样：<strong>这个人是否理解量表本身的定义</strong>，以及<strong>这个人的判断是否与平台的既有口径一致</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"考试题为什么必须覆盖边界情形\">考试题为什么必须覆盖边界情形</h3><p>由此推出两条设计原则。第一，考试题必须覆盖量表的边界情形，而不是典型情形。一个标注员知道「完全相关」和「不相关」的区别毫无价值，关键是他知道「部分相关」在什么情况下应该被判为「不相关」——这类边界题占考试题的比例应当不低于一半，因为真实任务流中引发分歧的主要就是这些边界。</p>\n<h3 id=\"重复题-一致率比正确率更有预测力\">重复题：一致率比正确率更有预测力</h3><p>第二，考试必须包含<strong>重复题</strong>。同一条题在考试中出现两次，且两次之间插入若干其他题目，如果一个人两次判断不一致，说明他并没有稳定的内在标准，无论他的绝对正确率多高，他在真实工作中的作用都更接近随机噪声源。重复题的一致率是比正确率更有预测力的信号，这一点在准入环节就应当被利用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>测什么</th>\n<th>典型规模</th>\n<th>通过线</th>\n<th>失败处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语言能力</td>\n<td>该语言的阅读理解</td>\n<td>20 题</td>\n<td>正确率 ≥ 80%</td>\n<td>不可重考该语言</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>量表理解</td>\n<td>定义与边界情形</td>\n<td>30 题（含 6 条重复题）</td>\n<td>正确率 ≥ 70% 且重复一致率 ≥ 80%</td>\n<td>冷却 7 天后重考一次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实操试标</td>\n<td>真实任务流下的产出</td>\n<td>20 条真实任务</td>\n<td>抽检正确率 ≥ 65%</td>\n<td>转入门槛更低的品类或退出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品类常识</td>\n<td>该品类的商品知识</td>\n<td>15 题</td>\n<td>正确率 ≥ 75%</td>\n<td>可换品类重考</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[注册] --&gt; B[语言能力考试]&#10;  B --&gt;|未过| X1[不可重考该语言]&#10;  B --&gt;|通过| C[量表理解考试&lt;br/&gt;含重复题]&#10;  C --&gt;|未过| X2[冷却7天重考一次]&#10;  C --&gt;|通过| D[品类常识考试]&#10;  D --&gt;|未过| X3[换品类重考]&#10;  D --&gt;|通过| E[实操试标 20 条]&#10;  E --&gt;|正确率不足| X4[转低门槛品类或退出]&#10;  E --&gt;|通过| F[进入保护期&lt;br/&gt;难度下限+保护价+高频抽检]&#10;  F --&gt; G[画像收敛 转常规期]\">graph TD\n  A[注册] --&gt; B[语言能力考试]\n  B --&gt;|未过| X1[不可重考该语言]\n  B --&gt;|通过| C[量表理解考试&lt;br/&gt;含重复题]\n  C --&gt;|未过| X2[冷却7天重考一次]\n  C --&gt;|通过| D[品类常识考试]\n  D --&gt;|未过| X3[换品类重考]\n  D --&gt;|通过| E[实操试标 20 条]\n  E --&gt;|正确率不足| X4[转低门槛品类或退出]\n  E --&gt;|通过| F[进入保护期&lt;br/&gt;难度下限+保护价+高频抽检]\n  F --&gt; G[画像收敛 转常规期]</pre><p>实操试标是准入的最后一关，也是唯一在真实工具链里发生的环节。它的意义不只是答题，还顺带测了两件事：这个人能否在平台界面里完成操作（交互成本高的平台会在这里筛掉一部分人），以及他的初始产能是多少（这个数字成为后续产能基线的锚点，见 <a href=\"labeler-capacity-payment\">产能管理与计件付费</a>）。</p>\n<p>四个环节的门槛应该是一份可版本化的配置，而不是散落在代码里的常量。理由是它会随量表修订而变：一次指南修订之后，量表理解与实操试标的通过线往往需要重新校准，而语言与品类常识的门槛基本不动。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;exam_profile&quot;: &quot;relevance-v3&quot;,&#10;  &quot;stages&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;stage&quot;: &quot;language&quot;, &quot;items&quot;: 20, &quot;pass&quot;: { &quot;accuracy&quot;: 0.8 }, &quot;retry&quot;: &quot;never&quot; },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;stage&quot;: &quot;rubric&quot;,&#10;      &quot;items&quot;: 30,&#10;      &quot;repeat_items&quot;: 6,&#10;      &quot;borderline_ratio&quot;: 0.5,&#10;      &quot;pass&quot;: { &quot;accuracy&quot;: 0.7, &quot;repeat_consistency&quot;: 0.8 },&#10;      &quot;retry&quot;: &quot;cooldown_7d_once&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    { &quot;stage&quot;: &quot;category&quot;, &quot;items&quot;: 15, &quot;pass&quot;: { &quot;accuracy&quot;: 0.75 }, &quot;retry&quot;: &quot;switch_category&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;stage&quot;: &quot;trial&quot;, &quot;items&quot;: 20, &quot;pass&quot;: { &quot;spot_accuracy&quot;: 0.65 }, &quot;retry&quot;: &quot;switch_category_or_exit&quot; }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"exam_profile\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"relevance-v3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"stages\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"stage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"language\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"items\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"pass\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"accuracy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"retry\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"never\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"stage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rubric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"items\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"repeat_items\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"borderline_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"pass\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"accuracy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"repeat_consistency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"retry\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cooldown_7d_once\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"stage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"category\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"items\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"pass\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"accuracy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.75</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"retry\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"switch_category\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"stage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"trial\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"items\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"pass\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"spot_accuracy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.65</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"retry\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"switch_category_or_exit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>borderline_ratio</code> 是那个「边界题不低于一半」的约束在配置里的落点。把它显式化之后，出题人可以按比例检查题库构成；如果一次修订把边界题比例降到了 0.3，通过率会立刻上升而真实工作中的分歧率会随后上升——这个配置让两件事之间有了可追溯的因果链。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分级-等级必须能升能降\">分级：等级必须能升能降</h2><h3 id=\"等级的三个差异维度\">等级的三个差异维度</h3><p>固定等级的问题在于它把一次考试的结果当成了永久的资质声明，而人的能力会变化：认真做几个月的人会变得更准，而把标注当副业随手做的人水平会退化。分级系统的设计目标是让等级<strong>反映当前状态</strong>而不是历史荣誉。</p>\n<p>一个可用的等级体系通常有 3 到 5 级，每级的差异体现在三件事上：可接任务的难度上限、计件单价、以及被抽检的频率。把抽检频率与等级绑定是一个巧妙的设计——高等级标注员被抽检得更少，这既是奖励（少被打扰）也是成本优化（质检成本下降），同时它隐含了一个风险：高等级标注员一旦退化，平台发现得慢。因此高等级的晋升不应该只看质量，还要看<strong>样本量</strong>，避免一个只标了 50 条而且标得不错的新人被快速推到高等级然后在无监督状态下退化。</p>\n<p>这三件事可以合并成一张等级表，每一行是一个等级，三列分别是难度上限、价格系数与抽检率。把抽检率放进等级表的意义是：它是唯一一个「越高等级越宽松」的参数，因此必须在配置里与价格并列，否则很容易在调参时被单独改掉而失去与等级的绑定关系。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>等级</th>\n<th>可接难度上限</th>\n<th>单价系数</th>\n<th>基础抽检率</th>\n<th>晋升所需最小样本</th>\n<th>典型人数占比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1</td>\n<td>0.3</td>\n<td>1.0</td>\n<td>20%</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>40%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2</td>\n<td>0.6</td>\n<td>1.2</td>\n<td>12%</td>\n<td>200</td>\n<td>35%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3</td>\n<td>0.85</td>\n<td>1.5</td>\n<td>6%</td>\n<td>600</td>\n<td>20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4</td>\n<td>1.0</td>\n<td>1.8</td>\n<td>3%</td>\n<td>1500</td>\n<td>5%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"滑动窗口与置信下界判定\">滑动窗口与置信下界判定</h3><p>等级升降的判定需要一个滑动窗口。用全部历史数据判定等级的问题是它对变化不敏感：一个标了两年的人即使近一个月开始敷衍，整体正确率仍然很高。用滑动窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 内的抽检正确率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 作为主要依据，并配合置信下界而不是点估计：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mtext>lower</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msub><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{new}} = f\\left(\\hat{p}_{\\text{lower}} = \\hat{p} - z_{1-\\alpha}\\sqrt{\\frac{\\hat{p}(1-\\hat{p})}{n}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lower</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7044em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-4.4em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6644em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:2.48em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"2.48em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 2592\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M424,2478\nc-1.3,-0.7,-38.5,-172,-111.5,-514c-73,-342,-109.8,-513.3,-110.5,-514\nc0,-2,-10.7,14.3,-32,49c-4.7,7.3,-9.8,15.7,-15.5,25c-5.7,9.3,-9.8,16,-12.5,20\ns-5,7,-5,7c-4,-3.3,-8.3,-7.7,-13,-13s-13,-13,-13,-13s76,-122,76,-122s77,-121,77,-121\ns209,968,209,968c0,-2,84.7,-361.7,254,-1079c169.3,-717.3,254.7,-1077.7,256,-1081\nl0 -0c4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000\nv40H1014.6\ns-87.3,378.7,-272.6,1166c-185.3,787.3,-279.3,1182.3,-282,1185\nc-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2z M1001 80\nh400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7356em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>用下界而不是点估计，效果是样本少的人会被保守对待，样本多的人才可能被推上高等级。这个选择牺牲了晋升速度，换来的是防止「小样本高分」的人群进入低质检的区间。</p>\n<p>同一个式子写成一条查询就是等级判定的批处理版本。注意 <code>n</code> 是窗口内的抽检条数而不是提交条数——用提交条数会让几乎不认真做的人因为量多而获得更窄的区间，方向恰好反了。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT labeler_id,&#10;       n, p_hat, p_lower,&#10;       CASE&#10;         WHEN p_lower &gt;= 0.95 AND n &gt;= 600  THEN &#39;L4&#39;&#10;         WHEN p_lower &gt;= 0.92 AND n &gt;= 200  THEN &#39;L3&#39;&#10;         WHEN p_lower &gt;= 0.88 AND n &gt;= 50   THEN &#39;L2&#39;&#10;         WHEN p_lower &gt;= 0.80               THEN &#39;L1&#39;&#10;         ELSE &#39;REVIEW&#39;                      -- 进入观察期，不直接降级&#10;       END AS proposed_level&#10;FROM (&#10;  SELECT labeler_id,&#10;         count(*)                                        AS n,&#10;         avg(correct::int)                               AS p_hat,&#10;         avg(correct::int) - 1.645&#10;           * sqrt(avg(correct::int) * (1 - avg(correct::int)) / count(*)) AS p_lower&#10;  FROM qa_samples&#10;  WHERE sampled_at &gt;= now() - interval &#39;60 days&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY labeler_id&#10;) w;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> labeler_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       n, p_hat, p_lower,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_lower </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">95</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 600</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'L4'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_lower </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">92</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 200</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'L3'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_lower </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">88</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 50</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'L2'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_lower </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">               THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'L1'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'REVIEW'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                      -- 进入观察期，不直接降级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> proposed_level</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> labeler_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(correct::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                               </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_hat,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(correct::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">645</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sqrt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(correct::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(correct::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_lower</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qa_samples</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sampled_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'60 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> labeler_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) w;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"降级为什么要比升级灵敏\">降级为什么要比升级灵敏</h3><p>降级必须比升级更灵敏。升级慢一天的代价是产能损失，降级慢一天的代价是持续产出低质量数据并污染下游。常见的做法是给降级设置一个更短的观察窗口和更高的敏感度，同时给降级一个申诉通道——因为抽检本身有误判概率，一次运气不好不应该直接降级。申诉通道的成本是运营人力，所以它只对「即将降级」这个状态开放，而不是对所有扣分开放。</p>\n<h2 id=\"培训-把量表内化-而不是把规则背下来\">培训：把量表内化，而不是把规则背下来</h2><h3 id=\"三部分培训结构\">三部分培训结构</h3><p>培训最容易做成一份规则文档，然后要求标注员背下来。这种方式在短期有效，长期必然失效，因为真实任务里的边界情形无法被穷举，遇到文档没写的情况时，背规则的人会凭感觉猜，而理解了量表的人会做出与平台一致的推断。</p>\n<p>有效的培训结构通常由三个部分构成。<strong>量表释义</strong>用正例与反例成对展示，强调每一级的判据而不是定义文字——例如「部分相关」的关键判据是「这条文档能满足查询的一个侧面需求」，配一组「满足了侧面需求」与「看起来像但没满足」的对照样例。<strong>分歧案例复盘</strong>把已经仲裁完成的历史分歧案例拿出来讲，让人看到同一个任务为什么会有人判 A 有人判 B，以及最终判定的理由。这类案例的说服力远强于抽象规则，而且它们来自真实数据，天然带着平台的口径。<strong>工具与流程演练</strong>让人在测试环境里完成一次完整的「接任务、提交、被打回、重标」循环，减少真实工作中的操作失误。</p>\n<h3 id=\"培训的另一重功能是筛选\">培训的另一重功能是筛选</h3><p>培训的另一个作用是<strong>筛选而非教育</strong>。有相当一部分人无论怎么培训都不会与平台口径一致，这不是能力问题而是标准差异问题——他对「相关」这个词的理解与业务定义不同。与其持续培训，不如在培训结束后用一批金标题做一次出口考核，把一致率长期低于门槛的人分流到其他类型的任务（例如不需要相关性判断的清洗类任务）或者直接结束合作。这个决定在情感上很硬，但它比让一个人在低质量岗位上反复被扣分要更尊重人。</p>\n<h2 id=\"冷启动与保护期\">冷启动与保护期</h2><h3 id=\"保护期的三个参数\">保护期的三个参数</h3><p>新人通过准入后进入一个尴尬状态：没有任何历史质量数据，因此分派系统不知道能把什么给他。第一章提到的保护期配额在这里落实为具体机制：<strong>前 N 条任务使用难度的下限、单价的保护价、以及更高频率的抽检</strong>。</p>\n<p>保护期的三个参数需要配合。难度下限保证新人不会一上来就撞到最主观的边界样本，从而积累起合理的信心与判断习惯；保护价保证新人前几天的收入不低于同等级的预期水平，避免他在建立画像之前就流失（留存问题见 <a href=\"labeler-retention-quality\">标注员留存与质量挂钩</a>）；高频率抽检则让画像尽快收敛，缩短保护期本身。这三者是同一条曲线上的取舍：抽检越密，保护期越短，平台越早得到可信的画像，成本是这段时间的质检开销。</p>\n<h3 id=\"出口条件为什么看置信区间宽度\">出口条件为什么看置信区间宽度</h3><p>保护期结束的判定不应该只看条数，还要看<strong>质量估计的置信区间宽度</strong>是否已经收缩到可用水平。一个标了 30 条但每条都在低信心状态下完成的人，其画像并不比只标了 10 条但很稳定的人更可信。用置信区间而非条数作为出口条件，可以让保护期对不同的人有不同长度，这是合理的：平台关心的是「我现在是否足够了解他」，不是「他是否标够了多少条」。</p>\n<p>出口判定因此是一条「区间宽度小于阈值」的查询，而不是「计数达到 N」的查询。阈值本身应当取该等级晋升所需的精度——保护期结束的质量估计如果不比晋升门槛更窄，那么它对新人的第一次分级就是靠猜。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT labeler_id,&#10;       count(*)      AS n,&#10;       avg(correct::int) AS p_hat,&#10;       2 * 1.96 * sqrt(avg(correct::int) * (1 - avg(correct::int)) / count(*))&#10;         AS ci_width&#10;FROM qa_samples&#10;WHERE labeler_id = $1&#10;  AND phase = &#39;probation&#39;&#10;GROUP BY labeler_id&#10;HAVING 2 * 1.96 * sqrt(avg(correct::int) * (1 - avg(correct::int)) / count(*)) &lt;= $2;&#10;&#10;-- 返回一行 → 画像已收敛，转入常规期；返回空 → 继续留在保护期配额内\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> labeler_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(correct::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p_hat,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">96</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sqrt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(correct::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(correct::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ci_width</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qa_samples</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> labeler_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> phase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'probation'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> labeler_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">96</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sqrt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(correct::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(correct::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 返回一行 → 画像已收敛，转入常规期；返回空 → 继续留在保护期配额内</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个查询有一个自然的上限保护：如果一个人质量极差（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 接近 0.5），区间宽度会长期无法收缩，保护期会无限延长。因此实际实现中要再加一条兜底——保护期最长不超过某个天数，超出后按当前下界直接定级，避免少数人占用保护期配额却不产生可用的画像。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>准入考试的重点是量表边界情形与重复题一致率，不是典型情形的正确率。</li>\n<li>实操试标是唯一在真实工具链中发生的环节，同时测出操作能力与初始产能基线。</li>\n<li>分级必须能升能降，用滑动窗口加置信下界判定，避免小样本高分被推到低质检区间。</li>\n<li>降级应当比升级更灵敏，并配一个只对「即将降级」开放的申诉通道。</li>\n<li>培训由量表释义、分歧案例复盘、流程演练三部分构成，其功能同时是筛选。</li>\n<li>保护期用难度下限、保护价、高频抽检三个参数配合，出口条件看置信区间宽度而非条数。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>准入与分级定了人的能力上限，接下来要看这些能力如何被换算成产出与报酬，见 <a href=\"labeler-capacity-payment\">产能管理与计件付费</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"标注员准入/分级/培训","id":"标注员准入-分级-培训"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：准入考试测的不是知识，是判断的一致性","id":"核心概念-准入考试测的不是知识-是判断的一致性"},{"level":3,"text":"考试题为什么必须覆盖边界情形","id":"考试题为什么必须覆盖边界情形"},{"level":3,"text":"重复题：一致率比正确率更有预测力","id":"重复题-一致率比正确率更有预测力"},{"level":2,"text":"分级：等级必须能升能降","id":"分级-等级必须能升能降"},{"level":3,"text":"等级的三个差异维度","id":"等级的三个差异维度"},{"level":3,"text":"滑动窗口与置信下界判定","id":"滑动窗口与置信下界判定"},{"level":3,"text":"降级为什么要比升级灵敏","id":"降级为什么要比升级灵敏"},{"level":2,"text":"培训：把量表内化，而不是把规则背下来","id":"培训-把量表内化-而不是把规则背下来"},{"level":3,"text":"三部分培训结构","id":"三部分培训结构"},{"level":3,"text":"培训的另一重功能是筛选","id":"培训的另一重功能是筛选"},{"level":2,"text":"冷启动与保护期","id":"冷启动与保护期"},{"level":3,"text":"保护期的三个参数","id":"保护期的三个参数"},{"level":3,"text":"出口条件为什么看置信区间宽度","id":"出口条件为什么看置信区间宽度"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"任务优先级与时效","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/relevance-crowdsourcing-label/label-task-dispatch/task-priority-sla"},"next":{"title":"产能管理与计件付费","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/relevance-crowdsourcing-label/labeler-management/labeler-capacity-payment"}}